<title>UK: Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 200 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau- und Bodenbank sets 200 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    26.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.82     FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
